<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>下利 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%A9/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Sat, 04 Apr 2026 18:42:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E4%B8%8B%E5%88%A9/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>呕吐哕下利病脉证治第十七</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/jingui-17/</link><pubDate>Sat, 05 Jul 2025 14:40:24 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/jingui-17/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E9%87%91%E5%8C%AE/">金匮</category><description>&lt;p&gt;这一篇有几种症状：呕、吐、哕、下利、放屁。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="夫呕家有痈脓不可治呕脓尽自愈"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;mark&gt;夫呕家有痈脓，不可治呕，脓尽自愈。&lt;/mark&gt;&lt;/span&gt;
 &lt;a href="#%e5%a4%ab%e5%91%95%e5%ae%b6%e6%9c%89%e7%97%88%e8%84%93%e4%b8%8d%e5%8f%af%e6%b2%bb%e5%91%95%e8%84%93%e5%b0%bd%e8%87%aa%e6%84%88" class="heading-mark"&gt;
